{# THE CONTRIBUTOR TAG — the architecture, visible in the product.

   Every widget on this surface was contributed by somebody, and it says so, in the plate's own
   tab strip. It is not decoration: it is how a person understands why a widget vanished when a
   module was uninstalled, and it is the only honest way to show that the page is composed rather
   than authored. No module writes this tag itself — the host prints it, from the provenance the
   catalogue already knows. #}
<span class="ao-by {{ slug }}"><i></i>{{ who }}</span>
